<title>USA: Calumet Bancorp to buy back 105,500 shrs.</title>
<headline>Calumet Bancorp to buy back 105,500 shrs.</headline>
<dateline>DOLTON, Ill. 1997-07-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Calumet Bancorp said Wednesday it will repurchase up to 105,500, or about five percent, of its shares.</p>
<p>The shares will be bought in open-market transactions subject to the availability of the stock, it said. As of June 30, the company had 2,110,797 shares outstanding.</p>
<p>-- Reuter Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787</p>
</text>
